# Flutter SDK

- Flutter **3.47.1**, Dart **3.13.1**, revision `6655482ec06e547f90abf8ae7590466f4415978d`.
- `pubspec.yaml` stays `environment.sdk: ^3.13.1`. `.fvmrc` stays `"flutter": "3.47.1"`.
- Run tooling with FVM. The shell `flutter` is 3.35.5 / Dart 3.9.2 and cannot compile this app.

```bash
fvm flutter analyze
fvm flutter test
fvm flutter run
fvm dart run build_runner build --delete-conflicting-outputs
```
